# Agent Notes

## Project Layout

- Durable planning docs live at the repo root: `design.md`, `memory.md`, `config.md`, `progress.md`, and `docs/`
- Runtime agent notes belong under `.agents/runs/`
- Workspace packages live under `packages/`
- Unit tests live in each package `test/` directory
- Cross-package integration tests live in `packages/integration/test/`

## Engineering Rules

- Extend the root `tsconfig.json` by default
- Keep shared utilities and types in `packages/common`
- Keep `build`, `dev`, `clean`, and `format` scripts aligned across packages
- Run repo-wide workflows from the root with `pnpm`

## Delivery Checklist

- update `design.md` when architecture changes
- capture durable decisions in `memory.md`
- keep `progress.md` current with active milestones and blockers
- move completed work items from `docs/` into `docs/.archive/` when they are finished
